                                                                                                                                                                                   'Reborn to conquer rugged frontiers this twin turbocharged off road machine combines retro heritage aesthetics with modern all terrain engineering hardware. Equipped with the Sasquatch package featuring thirty five inch mud terrain tires beadlock capable wheels and high clearance fender flares it clears obstacles effortlessly. Advanced Bilstein position sensitive dampers absorb violent trail shocks across high speed washboard desert runs and rocky technical ascents. Removable doors and roof panels allow complete sensory connection with pristine outdoor environments during warm weather trail expeditions. The interior features marine grade vinyl upholstery and rubberized drainable flooring making post trail wash downs remarkably simple and trouble free. Advanced GOAT driving modes adjust steering throttle and locking differential parameters to overcome sand mud rocks and snow at the twist of a dial. Embark on rugged backcountry camping excursions with total confidence inside this extraordinarily capable off road trail vehicle.', '2024-02-03 17:00:00'),

                                                                                                                                                                                  (30, 8, 'Volkswagen', 'Golf GTI', 'Budget,Premium', 16000.00, 'Columbus Short North, OH', 'Manual', 31200, 12.80, 2021, 2022, 'approved', NULL,
                                                                                                                                                                                   'The definitive hot hatchback this German icon delivers everyday practicality paired with razor sharp chassis tuning for spirited driving enthusiasts. A turbocharged two liter engine pulls vigorously across the rev range working through an engaging six speed manual transmission with short crisp throws. Signature plaid sport bucket seats provide great lateral support during vigorous cornering while preserving long distance comfort during highway commuting. The versatile hatchback configuration accommodates groceries musical instruments or bicycles effortlessly when the split rear seatbacks are folded flat. Electronic limited slip differential hardware helps pull the vehicle cleanly through tight corners with astonishing front end grip and zero understeer. Crisp digital instrumentation and intuitive touchscreen media keep you connected to your navigation apps and favorite playlists effortlessly throughout your journey. For renters seeking an engaging dynamic enthusiast machine without sacrificing comfort fuel economy or luggage versatility this iconic hatchback remains supreme.', '2024-02-03 18:00:00'),

                                                                                                                                                                                  (31, 9, 'Rivian', 'R1T Adventure', 'Electric,Offroad', 26000.00, 'Boulder Pearl St, CO', 'Auto', 15600, 505.00, 2023, 2023, 'approved', NULL,
                                                                                                                                                                                   'Pioneering the electric adventure vehicle revolution this quad motor pickup truck delivers mind boggling performance both on road and off road. With an electric motor dedicated to each individual wheel torque distribution is adjusted milliseconds faster than any mechanical differential can manage. The unique gear tunnel running transversely between the cab and bed offers lockable weather protected storage for outdoor equipment and luggage. Adjustable air suspension raises the truck to provide an astonishing fourteen inches of ground clearance or drops it down for highway efficiency. Luxurious interior appointments include sustainably sourced wood trims durable vegan leather seating and a removable Bluetooth camp speaker docked in the console. Rapid electric acceleration pushes the truck to highway speeds in supercar times while maintaining serene quietness inside the passenger cabin. Take your outdoor camping wilderness exploration and scenic mountain touring to unprecedented heights with this revolutionary electric adventure pickup.', '2024-02-04 09:00:00'),

                                                                                                                                                                                  (32, 10, 'Mercedes-Benz', 'E-Class E450', 'Luxury', 39000.00, 'Philadelphia Center City, PA', 'Auto', 22800, 11.20, 2022, 2022, 'approved', NULL,
                                                                                                                                                                                   'Representing the heartbeat of executive prestige this midsize German sedan combines classic craftsmanship with advanced artificial intelligence driving aids. A turbocharged inline six engine featuring an integrated starter generator provides seamless velvet smooth power delivery and remarkable fuel efficiency. The cabin provides a soothing retreat featuring dual digital display panels ambient lighting in sixty four colors and heated leather appointments. Acoustically insulated glass shields passengers from bustling city commotion while high fidelity Burmester surround audio fills the space with concert hall clarity. Semi autonomous driving assistants assist with highway navigation speed adjustments and evasive steering maneuvers ensuring relaxed long distance journey comfort. Sculpted exterior body contours exude stately confidence suitable for high level corporate presentations formal wedding galas and luxurious evening dining. Experience the pinnacle of automotive balance poise and executive elegance behind the wheel of this internationally admired luxury sedan.', '2024-02-04 10:00:00'),

                                                                                                                                                                                  (33, 3, 'Tesla', 'Model 3 Performance', 'Electric', 11500.00, 'San Jose Santana Row, CA', 'Auto', 26300, 505.00, 2022, 2022, 'approved', NULL,
                                                                                                                                                                                   'Engineered for sheer speed and agility this compact electric sedan turns everyday city driving into an exhilarating track like experience. Dual electric motors generate immediate torque rocketing the vehicle away from stops with neck snapping quickness and silent poise. Uprated performance brakes lowered sport suspension and lightweight twenty inch alloy wheels keep the sedan glued to tarmac through tight corners. The minimalist interior strips away clutter centering all vehicle operations music selections and climate controls on a crisp central touchscreen. A tinted glass panoramic roof arches over the entire cabin giving occupants sweeping views of coastal skies and tall city buildings. Track mode allows enthusiastic drivers to customize motor bias stability control thresholds and regenerative braking force according to their driving preferences. Enjoy rapid supercharger recharging access sports car handling and zero emissions on your next coastal highway road trip.', '2024-02-04 11:00:00'),

                                                                                                                                                                                  (34, 4, 'Chevrolet', 'Tahoe Premier', 'Budget,Premium', 14500.00, 'Kansas City Plaza, MO', 'Auto', 33700, 7.50, 2022, 2022, 'approved', NULL,
                                                                                                                                                                                   'Providing immense room commanding road presence and dependable capability this full size three row SUV accommodates large traveling groups with consummate ease. A muscular eight cylinder motor provides dependable towing muscle and smooth highway acceleration through a modern ten speed automatic transmission. Independent rear multi link suspension yields a composed road ride eliminating the harsh vibrations historically associated with large body on frame trucks. Inside the cavernous cabin three rows of comfortable leather seats accommodate up to eight passengers alongside significant luggage capacity in back. Tri zone automatic climate control USB charging points across all rows and ceiling mounted ventilation keep all occupants content on long journeys. Safety alerts surround the vehicle helping drivers navigate busy school zones crowded parking lots and narrow highway construction lanes easily. Rely on this proven spacious SUV for family road trips sports tournaments and corporate group transfers across metropolitan regions.', '2024-02-04 12:00:00'),

                                                                                                                                                                                  (35, 5, 'BMW', 'M3 Competition', 'Luxury,Premium', 25000.00, 'Atlanta Midtown, GA', 'Auto', 13900, 9.80, 2023, 2023, 'approved', NULL,
                                                                                                                                                                                   'An undisputed benchmark among sports sedans this aggressive performance icon blends track ready engineering with five passenger practical usability. The twin turbocharged three liter inline six engine revs freely unleashing immense horsepower through an exceptionally quick eight speed sport transmission. Stiffened chassis braces aerodynamic carbon fiber roof construction and wide performance rubber deliver immense lateral grip and razor sharp steering feedback. Inside sculpted M sport seats hold the driver firmly through extreme cornering forces while Merino leather upholstery imparts undeniable premium luxury. Dual digital panoramic displays integrate track telemetry navigation prompts and customized engine damper setup buttons right on the thick steering wheel. Ferocious carbon ceramic brakes bring high speed momentum down rapidly providing complete driver confidence during spirited weekend mountain drives. When you demand genuine sports car thrills without sacrificing four door usability this masterclass performance machine delivers with absolute distinction.', '2024-02-04 13:00:00'),

                                                                                                                                                                                  (36, 6, 'Toyota', 'Corolla LE', 'Budget', 8000.00, 'San Antonio Riverwalk, TX', 'Auto', 48900, 14.80, 2021, 2021, 'approved', NULL,
                                                                                                                                                                                   'Celebrated throughout the world for legendary durability and budget conscious operation this compact sedan is the quintessential sensible travel solution. Its efficient four cylinder engine pairs with a smooth continuously variable transmission to stretch every fuel tank over hundreds of interstate miles. Within the smartly organized interior comfortable fabric seating straightforward climate controls and clear gauge readouts make driving straightforward and stress free. Standard driver assist features include lane departure warning pre collision pedestrian detection and adaptive cruise control for relaxed highway motoring. The practical trunk compartment easily swallows luggage bags backpacks and shopping supplies ensuring great utility for tourists and business travelers alike. With compact exterior dimensions parking in tight downtown spaces or crowded parking garages is accomplished with effortless confidence and complete ease. Choose this economical dependable sedan for affordable reliable transportation that gets you to every destination without unexpected surprises.', '2024-02-04 14:00:00'),

                                                                                                                                                                                  (37, 7, 'Porsche', 'Cayenne GTS', 'Luxury,Premium', 59000.00, 'Newport Beach, CA', 'Auto', 16100, 6.90, 2022, 2023, 'approved', NULL,
                                                                                                                                                                                   'Proving that an authentic sports car spirit can flourish in a versatile sport utility format this performance SUV astounds with agility. A throaty twin turbocharged V8 engine delivers instantaneous power accompanied by a resonant sport tuned exhaust note that thrills occupants. Lowered adaptive air suspension coupled with Porsche active suspension management keeps body roll virtually non existent during spirited canyon carving. The lavish interior showcases Alcantara accents brushed aluminum trim deeply contoured leather sport seats and an intuitive widescreen infotainment system. Roomy second row seating and a capacious luggage compartment ensure family gear and golf bags are transported with effortless elegance. Massive multi piston brakes provide tremendous stopping power under hard driving inspiring absolute confidence regardless of speed or road weather conditions. For travelers who refuse to compromise between driving exhilaration and spacious family utility this German engineered machine represents the ultimate driving compromise.', '2024-02-04 15:00:00'),

                                                                                                                                                                                  (38, 8, 'Ford', 'Mustang Mach-E GT', 'Electric', 51000.00, 'Detroit Downtown, MI', 'Auto', 21800, 435.00, 2023, 2023, 'approved', NULL,
                                                                                                                                                                                   'Reinterpreting classic pony car soul through a cutting edge all electric crossover package this vehicle offers electrifying acceleration and high style. Twin electric motors generate massive torque that propels the car instantly providing thrilling launches while maintaining whisper quiet interior refinement. The striking profile features muscular haunches distinctive three bar taillights and an aggressive front fascia that pays homage to traditional heritage. Inside the bright minimalist cabin a massive portrait orientation touchscreen controls entertainment vehicle settings and intelligent cloud navigation with ease. MagneRide adaptive damping cushions rough city asphalt while firming up instantly through corners to preserve disciplined and engaging road handling. Ample rear passenger space along with front frunk storage and rear hatchback volume make it remarkably practical for weekend family trips. Experience iconic American performance heritage updated with modern sustainable zero emission technology on your next rental journey.', '2024-02-04 16:00:00'),

                                                                                                                                                                                  (39, 9, 'Lexus', 'RX 350 F Sport', 'Luxury', 23000.00, 'Richmond Downtown, VA', 'Auto', 27300, 10.50, 2022, 2022, 'approved', NULL,
                                                                                                                                                                                   'Blending sharp angular styling with famous Japanese reliability this midsize luxury crossover provides exceptional comfort and whisper quiet operational refinement. The responsive turbocharged powertrain delivers smooth acceleration while the F Sport tuned suspension strikes a nice balance between comfort and handling. Inside the cabin handcrafted leather seating dark aluminum trim touches and an intuitive widescreen touchscreen create a deeply tranquil luxury atmosphere. Meticulous acoustic sound deadening keeps wind rush and road vibrations outside the cabin ensuring peaceful conversations and relaxing audio playback. A comprehensive suite of active safety tech includes lane keep assist rear cross traffic braking and all speed dynamic radar cruise control. The spacious rear cargo compartment handles luggage golf bags or shopping finds with ease beneath a motorized hands free rear tailgate. Indulge in proven luxury reliability serene highway comfort and striking aesthetics by reserving this exceptional modern crossover vehicle.', '2024-02-04 17:00:00'),

                                                                                                                                                                                  (40, 10, 'Jeep', 'Grand Cherokee 4xe', 'Offroad,Electric', 24000.00, 'Jackson Hole, WY', 'Auto', 18900, 10.00, 2023, 2023, 'approved', NULL,
                                                                                                                                                                                   'Merging legendary off road heritage with modern plug in hybrid technology this capable sport utility vehicle conquers mountains with silent poise. The hybrid system allows silent electric zero emission driving along pristine scenic trails or combines gasoline power for hundreds of interstate miles. Quadra Trac four wheel drive combined with air suspension provides outstanding ground clearance water fording capability and rock crawling wheel articulation. Inside the cabin rich wood accents quilted Palermo leather seating and McIntosh high end audio create an extraordinarily luxurious passenger sanctuary. Multiple high resolution displays furnish the front passenger with individual entertainment while the driver monitors terrain maps and hybrid battery state. Whether navigating snow covered mountain passes heading into secluded backcountry fishing spots or pulling up to luxurious ski lodges this SUV delivers. Experience uncompromised mountain capability blended seamlessly with modern eco conscious efficiency throughout your alpine journey.', '2024-02-04 18:00:00'),

                                                                                                                                                                                  (41, 3, 'Genesis', 'G90 3.5T', 'Luxury', 26000.00, 'Nashville West End, TN', 'Auto', 12300, 8.90, 2023, 2023, 'approved', NULL,
                                                                                                                                                                                   'Rising boldly into the ultra luxury sedan arena this South Korean flagship sedan challenges traditional luxury hierarchies with breathtaking craftsmanship. The twin turbocharged V6 engine features an innovative electric supercharger that delivers immediate velvet smooth propulsion without any trace of turbo lag. Inside the cabin semi aniline leather seats feature massage functions power leg rests and mood curator settings that adjust fragrances and lighting. Multi chamber air suspension reads road conditions ahead adapting shock damping to glide over cracked asphalt with absolute cloud like serenity. Distinctive two line LED headlights and an expansive crest grille announce your arrival with understated elegance and commanding architectural road presence. Rear seat VIP touchscreens allow passengers to control rear seat climate sunshades audio playback and massage settings with simple fingertip taps. Choose this spectacular luxury saloon for executive transportation milestone celebrations or formal events where supreme serenity remains the ultimate priority.', '2024-02-05 09:00:00'),

                                                                                                                                                                                  (42, 4, 'Chevrolet', 'Camaro SS 1LE', 'Premium', 45000.00, 'Louisville Downtown, KY', 'Manual', 25600, 8.10, 2021, 2021, 'approved', NULL,
                                                                                                                                                                                   'Engineered for track focused driving purists this high performance American muscle machine provides extraordinary handling agility and intoxicating V8 power. Under the satin black hood sits a rumbling 6.2 liter naturally aspirated engine that responds with explosive power at any rpm. The six speed manual gearbox includes rev matching technology allowing precise heel toe downshifts without requiring complex foot pedal dancing maneuvers. Track oriented 1LE package upgrades include aggressive aerodynamic front splitters dual mode performance exhaust Brembo brakes and wide Goodyear Eagle supercar tires. Inside Recaro sport bucket seats hold occupants firmly against immense cornering g forces generated along winding mountain asphalt and race courses. Magnetic ride suspension analyzes road conditions continuously adjusting damper stiffness to maintain unshakable tire contact through bumpy corners. For enthusiasts who appreciate traditional three pedal driving and track honed handling precision this performance coupe delivers pure automotive adrenaline.', '2024-02-05 10:00:00'),

                                                                                                                                                                                  (43, 5, 'Lucid', 'Air Touring', 'Electric,Luxury', 31000.00, 'Palo Alto University Ave, CA', 'Auto', 10800, 680.00, 2023, 2023, 'approved', NULL,
                                                                                                                                                                                   'Representing the zenith of electric range aerodynamics and interior packaging this futuristic California designed luxury sedan sets new engineering records. Compact proprietary electric motors produce exhilarating acceleration delivering hundreds of miles of highway range on a single battery charging session. An architectural glass canopy roof floods the passenger cabin with natural light while specialized solar protective glass coatings deflect excessive thermal heat. Inside the cabin luxurious sustainable materials including alpaca wool blends full grain nappa leather and open pore eucalyptus wood establish understated elegance. A thirty four inch curved 5K display floats gracefully before the driver presenting navigation multimedia and vehicle controls with brilliant clarity. The remarkably low center of gravity and tuned chassis yield astonishing cornering agility and composure over coarse highway surfaces. Reserve this revolutionary luxury EV to experience unmatched engineering efficiency breathtaking electric velocity and peerless modern luxury sophistication.', '2024-02-05 11:00:00'),

                                                                                                                                                                                  (44, 6, 'Subaru', 'Crosstrek Limited', 'Budget,Offroad', 18000.00, 'Boise Downtown, ID', 'Auto', 34200, 12.30, 2022, 2022, 'approved', NULL,
                                                                                                                                                                                   'Combining compact city friendly maneuverability with rugged all weather mountain capability this versatile crossover handles everyday adventures with ease. Standard symmetrical all wheel drive paired with impressive ground clearance ensures confident traction over snowy mountain passes muddy camp roads and gravel. An efficient four cylinder engine delivers solid fuel economy while the rugged exterior body cladding protects wheel arches from stone chips. Inside the cabin durable leather seating contrast orange stitching and an intuitive touchscreen display create a comfortable and modern environment. Subaru EyeSight driver assistance monitors surrounding traffic providing pre collision braking adaptive cruise control and lane keep assistance for maximum peace of mind. Generous rear hatchback space and roof rails accommodate mountain bikes camping gear and snowboards for spontaneous weekend outdoor exploration journeys. Economical rugged and wonderfully practical this compact crossover is the ultimate multi functional vehicle for active travelers.', '2024-02-05 12:00:00'),

                                                                                                                                                                                  (45, 7, 'Audi', 'Q7 55 TFSI', 'Luxury', 32000.00, 'Milwaukee Lakefront, WI', 'Auto', 26800, 9.30, 2022, 2022, 'approved', NULL,
                                                                                                                                                                                   'Offering three rows of refined German luxury this versatile SUV provides upscale family transportation with confidence and poised handling dynamics. A turbocharged V6 engine with mild hybrid technology delivers smooth responsive acceleration through an eight speed Tiptronic transmission and legendary Quattro AWD. The cabin exemplifies minimalist prestige featuring dual touch response central screens Audi virtual cockpit and rich leather seating for seven passengers. Acoustic laminated side glass and advanced suspension damping ensure an exceptionally quiet cabin environment even when cruising at high interstate speeds. Split folding second and third row seating configurations provide massive cargo flexibility for sports gear luggage or home improvement shopping trips. Comprehensive safety systems include side assist exit warning rear cross traffic alert and adaptive cruise assist to safeguard all your precious passengers. Travel in quintessential German comfort prestige and all weather poise with this beautifully appointed seven passenger luxury SUV.', '2024-02-05 13:00:00'),

                                                                                                                                                                                  (46, 8, 'Kia', 'EV6 GT-Line', 'Electric', 12000.00, 'Raleigh Downtown, NC', 'Auto', 19700, 490.00, 2023, 2023, 'approved', NULL,
                                                                                                                                                                                   'With dramatic crossover styling and blistering electric performance this aerodynamic EV brings futuristic design to everyday highway journeys. The dual motor electric all wheel drive system launches with immediate authority while delivering crisp responsive handling through tightly curved roads. Ultra fast 800 volt charging architecture allows the battery to replenish from ten to eighty percent in under twenty minutes at fast chargers. Step inside to discover augmented reality head up display curved panoramic instrument screens and distinctive geometric interior door panel accents. Sustainable vegan leather sport seats offer heated and ventilated comfort while the flat cabin floor maximizes legroom throughout both rows. The innovative vehicle to load system provides power outlets that can run laptops camping equipment and small appliances from the battery. Experience lightning fast electric acceleration forward thinking technology and striking road presence behind the wheel of this acclaimed modern EV.', '2024-02-05 14:00:00'),

                                                                                                                                                                                  (47, 9, 'Mazda', 'MX-5 Miata Club', 'Budget,Premium', 23000.00, 'San Diego Balboa Park, CA', 'Manual', 21300, 14.50, 2022, 2022, 'approved', NULL,
                                                                                                                                                                                   'Celebrated as the ultimate lightweight sports car this iconic Japanese roadster delivers pure unfiltered driving joy with every single curve. A high revving naturally aspirated two liter engine pairs with one of the most delightful six speed manual shifters ever engineered. Weighing barely over a ton the car responds telepathically to minute steering adjustments providing an intimate connection to the pavement below. The manual fabric soft top drops with one quick arm movement from the driver seat opening up blue skies in seconds. Club package upgrades include a limited slip differential Bilstein dampers Brembo front brakes and lightweight BBS wheels for enhanced cornering tenacity. Inside the snug driver oriented cockpit keeps all controls intuitive allowing you to concentrate solely on the thrill of the winding drive. Turn any weekend road trip along coastal cliff roads into an unforgettable celebration of classic sports car minimalism.', '2024-02-05 15:00:00'),

                                                                                                                                                                                  (48, 10, 'Ram', '1500 TRX', 'Offroad,Luxury', 28000.00, 'Oklahoma City Bricktown, OK', 'Auto', 18200, 5.10, 2022, 2022, 'approved', NULL,
                                                                                                                                                                                   'A supercharged apex predator among off road trucks this massive machine dominates desert dunes and paved interstates with equal authority. Under the scooped hood lies a hellcat supercharged 6.2 liter V8 engine producing a staggering supercharged roar and instantaneous explosive acceleration. Custom Bilstein Black Hawk e2 adaptive dampers and massive thirty five inch all terrain tires soak up punishing desert washboards at high speeds. The aggressive widebody styling is eight inches wider than standard pickups giving it an intimidating stance that clears highway lanes effortlessly. Inside the cabin premium leather wraps bolstered seats while carbon fiber trim and a giant twelve inch infotainment display provide luxury comfort. Advanced launch control and dedicated off road telemetry screens allow enthusiastic drivers to record performance metrics and off road parameters accurately. Dominate any terrain highway or job site with unprecedented supercharged truck muscle unmatched suspension capability and supreme luxury.', '2024-02-05 16:00:00'),

                                                                                                                                                                                  (49, 3, 'BMW', 'i4 M50', 'Electric,Luxury', 18000.00, 'Ann Arbor Downtown, MI', 'Auto', 14900, 435.00, 2023, 2023, 'approved', NULL,
                                                                                                                                                                                   'Merging quintessential BMW sports sedan agility with silent electric propulsion this dual motor Gran Coupe delivers tremendous performance and refinement. Electric all wheel drive channels massive horsepower instantly providing supercar grade acceleration that pushes passengers firmly back into sculpted sport bucket seats. Adaptive M suspension variable sport steering and a low center of gravity grant extraordinary precision when carving through winding mountain switchbacks. Inside the cabin an expansive curved glass display unites the digital gauge cluster and central infotainment screen beneath intuitive iDrive controls. The practical rear liftback design opens wide to reveal a generous luggage compartment capable of accommodating large suitcases and sports gear. Acoustic glazing shields occupants from highway tire roar while artificial propulsion sounds composed by Hans Zimmer add cinematic drama under acceleration. Enjoy seamless electric efficiency thrilling German dynamics and head turning coupe styling with this exceptional all electric sports machine.', '2024-02-05 17:00:00'),

                                                                                                                                                                                  (50, 4, 'Mercedes-Benz', 'GLS 580 4MATIC', 'Luxury', 55000.00, 'Greenwich Ave, CT', 'Auto', 13400, 7.80, 2023, 2023, 'approved', NULL,
                                                                                                                                                                                   'Often referred to as the S-Class of SUVs this palatial three row luxury vehicle accommodates seven passengers in pure first class comfort. A twin turbocharged V8 engine featuring EQ Boost mild hybrid technology delivers effortless whisper quiet power through a smooth nine speed transmission. E-Active body control suspension scans road surfaces ahead smoothing out harsh bumps while leaning gently into corners to minimize passenger lateral motion. The cavernous interior features heated and cooled massage seats open pore walnut woodwork and sixty four color ambient mood lighting throughout. Five zone climate control and individual USB ports ensure all occupants travel with personalized comfort across long distance family holiday vacations. Power folding second and third row seating allows seamless transformation from passenger transport to massive flat floor cargo hauling capability. Indulge your family with unmatched German engineering regal road presence and cloud like highway composure behind the wheel of this flagship SUV.', '2024-02-05 18:00:00');
